{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0018","name":"周晋","evidence":["wendi-q-o028"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wendi-m-o028-wendi-p0018","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["wendi-q-o028"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-q-o028","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-9204f4c854f659a541df","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，丙寅朔，日有食之。庚午〖2〗，行幸许昌宫。诏曰：“今之计、（考）〔孝〕〖3〗，古之贡士也。十室之邑，必有忠信。若限年然后取士〖4〗，是吕尚、周晋不显于前世也〖5〗。其令郡国所选，勿拘老幼；儒通经术，吏达文法〖6〗，到，皆试用。有司纠故不以实者〖7〗。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":281,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":138}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
